# Section 05 — the Log. Copy to .env.local for development.
#
# With BOTH unset the Log section does not render and the site is exactly what
# it was before it existed. That is the default, and it is the safe one: set
# these only when you are ready for the board to be public.
#
# Find them in Supabase → Project Settings → API.
#
# The anon key is PUBLIC. It ships in the JavaScript bundle by design and is
# safe there — it identifies the project, it does not authorise anything. All
# the access it has is defined in supabase/notes.sql: insert an unapproved row,
# read approved rows. Never put the service_role key here; that one bypasses
# every policy and would let anyone publish straight to the board.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=qmwwypruaidzsxgrezsh
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6InFtd3d5cHJ1YWlkenN4Z3JlenNoIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODgyMTI3NjAsImV4cCI6MjEwMzc4ODc2MH0.JHy7x3Vkk_VFHomEVsrHdtBXTatmX8Tz_tTSIK0xpXg
